<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34663" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμφῡσ-άω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>blow in</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς τὰς ῥῖνας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>CA</u>
					1.2
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				1088.37
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐλητρὶς ἐνεφύσησε</span>
			<i>breathed into</i> the flute, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				1219
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἴνῳ ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hippiatr.</u>
				11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>breathe upon</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί, εἴς
			τινα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Jb.</u>
				4.21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ez.</u>
				37.9
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Jo.</u>
				20.22
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>blow up, inflate</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ μὲν</span>
				[<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς τροφῆς</span>] 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμφυσᾶν, τὸ δὲ σαρκοῦν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					603b30
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τὰς φλέβας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					881b14
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be inflated</i> or, generally, <i>swollen</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Coac.</u>
				154
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				524a17
			</span></i>, al.: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ κολακείᾳ ἐμφυσώμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Clearch.
					25
				</span></i>
			.</div>
